  contentHtml: '\n<p><a href="https://microsoftedge.microsoft.com/addons/detail/unhook-remove-youtube-r/hebpjnnclppdnfghdnmhgdljmjpfhggk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Unhook &#8211; Remove YouTube Recommended Videos &#8211; Microsoft Edge Addons</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Sometimes it is nice to not be distracted by the thumbnails of videos that keep you hooked on YouTube. To get better work done, especially if you have ADD or ADHD, this plugin for most major web browsers will remove many distractions and annoyances. I&#8217;m fairly simple, so all I use it for is to hide the suggestions, but it has all of these features (as of 6/19/2023):</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="357" height="439" sizes="auto, (max-width: 357px) 100vw, 357px" src="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/image-4.png" alt="" class="wp-image-5912"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="361" height="440" sizes="auto, (max-width: 361px) 100vw, 361px" src="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/image-5.png" alt="" class="wp-image-5913"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="359" height="119" sizes="auto, (max-width: 359px) 100vw, 359px" src="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/image-7.png" alt="" class="wp-image-5915"/></figure>\n',
